actual html template is returned from backend django server so we make template folder in app then create a html file in that folder

template engine:
what? django has template engine to render the dynamic data.
django has context -> which comes into play when we want to display some data coming from backend to the ui 

template tags in django -> built in tags 

oop has a concept called DRY donot repeat yourself
 but here we are repeating the initioal body of html everywhere in all pages. that's why we will create a file base.html in templates folder 
 in this file (Base.html) we have the repatble code 
 eg.

