...file contents...
{% endblock%}


## migrations
search - > django models 

python manage.py make migrations , to create these tabes described in models in db

python manage.py migrate

que. What will happen if we delete any ,igration file?
     django also stores all the migrations in the db so if we deltete then if will compare those both and will know that something is deleted it will throw an error. django internally when we hit python manage.py command it runs all the migrations and makes a state of modals then compares with the state of model in db if matches exactly then nothing changed or if not matched.


